{title: Katra Katra}
{artist: Ankit Tiwari Alone}
{key: Dm}

{c: Verse 1}
Is [Dm]tarah se,        [Am]Khud se aa [A#]mujhko jod [Gm]tu
[Dm]Thoda bhi,        [Am]Mujh me na [A#]muzko chhod [Gm]tu
Na [Dm]yaad teri [Am]tujhko,        Na [A#]yaad mujhe hoon [Gm]main
Aa [Dm]mujhko pehen le [Am]tu,        Aa [A#]tujhko odh loon [Gm]main
[Dm]Katra katra main [A#]giroon,        [Dm]Jism pe tere [C]theheroon
[Dm]Katra katra main [A#]giroon,        [Dm]Tujh mein hi kahin reh [A#]loon
